  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(１) 【株主総会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:28.5pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(２) 【取締役会決議による取得の状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:28.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
